<InfoPage title="Contact" kicker="Corrections and rights" description="How to contact this independent Playbox AI publication about factual corrections, source updates, privacy, consent, or rights concerns."><h2>Editorial requests</h2><p>Include the affected URL, the exact statement or asset, the reason for the request, and a primary source supporting the correction.</p><h2>Do not send images or videos</h2><p>We do not need account credentials, source photos, generated videos, identification documents, or sensitive media to review a correction or rights concern.</p><h2>Editorial address</h2><p>The planned address is <strong>support@playboxai.fun</strong>. Mail delivery has not yet been configured, so we cannot guarantee that messages sent there will arrive or receive a reply. For Playbox.com account, billing or content removal issues, contact the official service directly.</p></InfoPage>
